    "comment": "Tem (kdh-kdh) = 3 (Wider communication). Tem people emigrated from what is now Burkina Faso to Togo during the 16th and 17th centuries. Became widely used throughout Togo due to trade in local markets. Spoken throughout various parts of western Africa."
